%% Who talks to whom for one ordinary question, with one rejected answer.
%% Every other branch (the reminder, the last answer-only turn, the 30-minute limit) is in question-states.mmd.
sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(238,242,255) On the host
        participant R as Runner
    end
    box rgb(236,253,245) Sandbox, no internet
        participant S as AI agent (pi)
    end
    box rgb(254,252,232) Course baseline
        participant C as Answer checker (normalize_response)
    end
    box rgb(255,247,237) Services
        participant G as Model gateway (LiteLLM)
        participant P as Phoenix (call log)
        participant M as Bailian qwen3.8-flash
    end

    R->>S: Start the container: input folder (page images, text layer, task), output folder
    S->>G: Task, page images, tool list
    G->>M: The same request, with the API key added
    G--)P: A copy of the call
    M-->>S: Call zoom on part of page 1
    Note over S: Crops and enlarges that area
    S->>M: The enlarged image
    Note over S,M: Every call takes the same path through the gateway, which logs a copy in Phoenix.
    M-->>S: Call answer with a value
    S->>C: The answer
    C-->>S: Rejected: wrong format, and why
    S->>M: "Rejected", with the reason
    M-->>S: Call answer with a corrected value
    S->>C: The corrected answer
    C-->>S: Valid
    Note over S: Saves answer.json in the output folder and ends the session
    S-->>R: The container exits
    R->>C: answer.json, checked again
    C-->>R: Valid
    Note over R: Saves the question's record
